"""One place for the AI disclosure and disclaimer shown on everything this project produces.

Three honest cases, which must not be blurred:
  "rules"        generated by software that was written with AI assistance. No AI model wrote
                 the words: they are extracted by programmed rules.
  "extraction"   the minutes themselves, tidied by that software; the words are the Mairie's.
  "site"         the website and documents themselves, written with AI assistance.
  "summary"      written by an AI model at run time.
  "translation"  translated by an AI model at run time.
Every notice says that no person has checked the output and that the original is authoritative.
The French, English and Dutch wording was itself written by the AI assistant and has not been
reviewed by a native speaker (see AI.md).
"""
